          ]
        },
        "202550001": {
          "id": 202550001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "我又来了！",
          "next": [
            202550002
          ]
        },
        "202550002": {
          "id": 202550002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "找回这个陈年老号，虽然费了点功夫，收获也不小",
          "next": [
            202550003
          ]
        },
        "202550003": {
          "id": 202550003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "嘿嘿",
          "next": [
            202550004,
            202550005,
            202550006
          ]
        },
        "202550004": {
          "id": 202550004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "不是，怎么变五星了？",
          "next": [
            202550007
          ]
        },
        "202550005": {
          "id": 202550005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "甩掉你团结一心的债主们了？",
          "next": [
            202550009
          ]
        },
        "202550006": {
          "id": 202550006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "嘿嘿…有什么收获？发现这个号有余额可以还债？",
          "next": [
            202550011
          ]
        },
        "202550007": {
          "id": 202550007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "多就是好，五星就是好评！",
          "next": [
            202550008
          ]
        },
        "202550008": {
          "id": 202550008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "也是，对冲下债主给的零星差评",
          "next": [
            202550011
          ]
        },
        "202550009": {
          "id": 202550009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "没有，但我会努力不辜负他们的期待",
          "next": [
            202550010
          ]
        },
        "202550010": {
          "id": 202550010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "那原来是期待吗？",
          "next": [
            202550011
          ]
        },
        "202550011": {
          "id": 202550011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "尖锐了啊，代理人",
          "next": [
            202550012
          ]
        },
        "202550012": {
          "id": 202550012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "现在看看这个备忘录的含金量，抵得上过去十年的产出",
          "next": [
            202550013
          ]
        },
        "202550013": {
          "id": 202550013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "命途行者锐评自家星神的录音、随手保存的八卦影像，都是独家素材啊",
          "next": [
            202550014
          ]
        },
        "202550014": {
          "id": 202550014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "当年我怎么就把这个号给丢了……",
          "next": [
            202550015,
            202550016,
            202550017
          ]
        },
        "202550015": {
          "id": 202550015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "别光说呀！一键转发给我",
          "next": [
            202550018
          ]
        },
        "202550016": {
          "id": 202550016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "又要画你自己的野史吗？",
          "next": [
            202550019
          ]
        },
        "202550017": {
          "id": 202550017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "马老师，饿饿，饭饭",
          "next": [
            202550021
          ]
        },
        "202550018": {
          "id": 202550018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "别急～先分享你一个",
          "next": [
            202550023
          ]
        },
        "202550019": {
          "id": 202550019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "没那么野",
          "next": [
            202550020
          ]
        },
        "202550020": {
          "id": 202550020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "我的意思是，格局没那么小！野史当然是别人的好看，比如……",
          "next": [
            202550023
          ]
        },
        "202550021": {
          "id": 202550021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "这会儿能做的饭可就太多了。感觉《药香缠风》也有素材更新了……",
          "next": [
            202550022
          ]
        },
        "202550022": {
          "id": 202550022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "先随便分享你一个",
          "next": [
            202550023
          ]
        },
        "202550023": {
          "id": 202550023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "数百个琥珀纪前，一位虚构史学家留下绝笔——",
          "next": [
            202550024
          ]
        },
        "202550024": {
          "id": 202550024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "「塔伊兹育罗斯蠕蠕而动，日行千里，只为一个无名星球…」",
          "next": [
            202550025
          ]
        },
        "202550025": {
          "id": 202550025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "「而彼时，太一和希佩也正埋伏在星球附近的隐秘角落里…」",
          "next": [
            202550026
          ]
        },
        "202550026": {
          "id": 202550026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "「祂们和奥博洛斯不期而遇，众神狭路相逢，剑拔弩张，火花四射，却只为一个人…」",
          "next": [
            202550027
          ]
        },
        "202550027": {
          "id": 202550027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "「阿哈，就在那里。」",
          "next": [
            202550028,
            202550029,
            202550030
          ]
        },
        "202550028": {
          "id": 202550028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "别太自恋了阿哈！",
          "next": [
            202550031
          ]
        },
        "202550029": {
          "id": 202550029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "这还不是你的野史吗！怎么还来这一套！",
          "next": [
            202550031
          ]
        },
        "202550030": {
          "id": 202550030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "说实话，我有些看腻了，有没有其他新鲜点的？",
          "next": [
            202550031
          ]
        },
        "202550031": {
          "id": 202550031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "没说完呢…史学家没来得及知晓的真相：「众神对无名星球垂涎三尺，是因为…」",
          "next": [
            202550032
          ]
        },
        "202550032": {
          "id": 202550032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "「阿哈早年练手的剧本、画本、同人本都藏在那里。」",
          "next": [
            202550033
          ]
        },
        "202550033": {
          "id": 202550033,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "「祂，想在那里蛀下。祂，想要独食。祂，和祂，则想要得到…」",
          "next": [
            202550034
          ]
        },
        "202550034": {
          "id": 202550034,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "嘻嘻，毕竟我是真的画过",
          "next": [
            202550035
          ]
        },
        "202550035": {
          "id": 202550035,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "备忘录里还有几篇现成的，马上发你品鉴",
          "next": [
            202550036
          ]
        },
        "202550036": {
          "id": 202550036,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 241,
          "text": "不吊胃口了，别待会没话费了",
          "next": [
            202550037
          ]
        },
        "202550037": {
          "id": 202550037,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "对方正在输入中",
          "next": [
            202550038
          ]
        },
